# PennyWise – Personal Budget Tracker

**PROG7313 POE Part 3 Final Submission**

## Student
- Name: Mpumelelo Chonco
- Student Number: ST10449316

## App Purpose
PennyWise helps users track expenses, set minimum and maximum spending goals, and stay on budget. Data syncs online via Firebase.

## Features
- User registration & login (secure hashing)
- Add/edit/delete expenses with receipt photo
- Category management
- Monthly budget goals with **min and max** limits
- **Graph** showing spending per category with min/max lines
- **Progress dashboard** showing compliance with min/max goals
- **Achievement badges** (Budget Beginner, etc.)
- **Subscription detector** (finds recurring expenses)
- **Online database** (Firestore) – data accessible from multiple devices

